  <p id="c-nanqishu-031-jiangmi-father:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-031-jiangmi-father:p001:m0000" ref="iuq_5o2_wum_AAAA">江謐</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-031-jiangmi-father:p001:m0003" ref="iuq_5o2_wum_AAAA">令和</persName>，濟陽考城人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-031-jiangmi-father:p001:m0014" ref="iuq_5o2_wum_AA">秉之</persName>，臨海太守，宋世清吏。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-031-jiangmi-father:p001:m0028" ref="iuq_5o2_wum_AAA">徽</persName>，尚書都官郎，吳令，爲太初所殺。</p>
